---
// A fine graduated rule: one long tick, then minor ticks every 8px.
---

<svg class="tickrule" width="100%" height="10" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="0" y1="0.5" x2="100%" y2="0.5" class="tr-base"></line><line x1="8" y1="4" x2="100%" y2="4" class="tr-minor"></line><line x1="0.5" y1="0" x2="0.5" y2="10" class="tr-major"></line></svg>
